Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.97,0:05:30.85,Default,sign,0,0,0,,{\shad0\an1\fnArial Black\c&H451C8A&\3c&HF3F0EF&\4c&H12181A&\pos(402.882,254.031)\frz346.7}Lindja {\bord0\c&HF7F3F1&}kryeson
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.85,0:05:33.60,Default,sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnArial Black\c&HEBEBEB&\3c&H12181A&\4c&H12181A&\pos(368,38.308)\frz346.7}Diferenca në zhetonë
